{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-practice-45","level":"A1","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"Gemischte Wiederholung","bn":"মিশ্র পুনরাবৃত্তি"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich schreibe ___ Freundin eine E-Mail. (meine)","answers":["meiner"],"options":["meiner","meinem","meinen"],"promptBn":"কাকে লেখা → Dativ: meine → meiner","id":"a1-practice-45-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das Kind gibt ___ Hund Wasser. (der)","answers":["dem"],"options":["dem","den","das"],"promptBn":"Dativ: der → dem","id":"a1-practice-45-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich habe keine Zeit, ___ ich muss arbeiten.","answers":["denn"],"options":["denn","aber","oder"],"promptBn":"কারণ বোঝাতে কোন সংযোজক?","id":"a1-practice-45-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wir haben einen Termin ___ Arzt.","answers":["beim"],"options":["beim","bei","mit"],"promptBn":"bei + dem → beim","id":"a1-practice-45-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Kannst du ___ morgen anrufen? (ich)","answers":["mich"],"options":["mich","dich","ihn"],"promptBn":"anrufen + Akkusativ: ich → mich","id":"a1-practice-45-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich danke ___ für das Geschenk. (du)","answers":["dir"],"options":["dir","mir","ihm"],"promptBn":"danken + Dativ: du → dir","id":"a1-practice-45-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Er kauft im Supermarkt Brot ___. (einkaufen)","answers":["ein"],"options":["ein","eine","einen"],"promptBn":"trennbares Verb: উপসর্গ বাক্যের শেষে","id":"a1-practice-45-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Die Kinder spielen im Garten, ___ es ist kalt.","answers":["aber"],"options":["aber","oder","denn"],"promptBn":"বিপরীত কথা বোঝাতে কোন সংযোজক?","id":"a1-practice-45-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Am Montag ___ ich früh aufstehen.","answers":["muss"],"options":["muss","musst","müssen"],"promptBn":"বাধ্যবাধকতা (müssen): ich → muss","id":"a1-practice-45-q9"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wann holst du deine Mutter vom Bahnhof ___? (abholen)","answers":["ab"],"options":["ab","an","aus"],"promptBn":"abholen → holst … ab","id":"a1-practice-45-q10"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Am Montag ___ ich um sieben Uhr ___. (aufstehen)","answers":["stehe","auf"],"options":["stehe","auf","stehst","am"],"promptBn":"দুটি ঘরই পূরণ করুন","explanation":"aufstehen → stehe … auf","id":"a1-practice-45-q11"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich fahre ___ dem Bus ___ Arbeit.","answers":["mit","zur"],"options":["mit","zur","beim","zum"],"promptBn":"যানবাহন, আর কোথায় যাওয়া","explanation":"mit dem Bus, zur (zu der) Arbeit","id":"a1-practice-45-q12"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der Kurs beginnt ___ Montag ___ neun Uhr.","answers":["am","um"],"options":["am","um","an","auf"],"promptBn":"দিনের আগে আর সময়ের আগে","explanation":"am Montag, um neun Uhr","id":"a1-practice-45-q13"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Am Wochenende gebe ich viel Geld ___. (ausgeben)","answers":["aus"],"options":["aus","mit","von"],"promptBn":"ausgeben → gebe … aus","id":"a1-practice-45-q14"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich ___ heute nicht kommen, ___ ich bin krank.","answers":["kann","denn"],"options":["kann","denn","kannst","aber"],"promptBn":"Modalverb আর কারণ বোঝানো সংযোজক","explanation":"ich kann …, denn …","id":"a1-practice-45-q15"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a1-practice-45","level":"A1","test":[]}